[{"title":"玉海诗 其三","author":"彻鉴堂","text":"平抟羊角看逍遥，袖拂虹冈万里桥。\n地涌祥云红鹤舞，天开瑞雨白龙朝。\n三吞香溢琪山钵，九奏风生玉陛韶。\n一种银家堆紫雾，笑称秦女和萧箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6502,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谪星绝笔","author":"彻鉴堂","text":"画虎屠龙叹旧图，血书才了凤睛枯。\n迄今十丈鄱阳水，流尽当年泪点无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6503,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙钱诗","author":"彻鉴堂","text":"为种蟠桃树，千年一颗生。\n是谁来窃去，唯问董双成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6504,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀春诗","author":"萧贞玉","text":"沉印香花四寸罗，银尖弹凤丽情多。\n可怜十度传觞手，未向红窗写翠娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6505,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上玉帝","author":"云贞","text":"云花徉傥迥难群，二百丛中第一人。\n气压昆仑无剩璧，才流江海有馀垠。\n昂藏踏践红龙爪，号叫冲开白兔鳞。\n早赐彤庭纶握事，何辞匍匐献丹宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6506,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙子七月初一日，赴乩申谢","author":"周贞环","text":"跳出尘埃入玉乡，琼楼深处叩穹苍。\n繁华总是无根草，宝月方知碧海长。\n有处秋声鹤唳语，无愁菩化兔园香。\n劳君祝我三生句，拭笔犹描紫翠堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6507,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彤玉诗二首 其一","author":"无名氏","text":"倒到月圆已及瓜，金肠舍肺吐丹霞。\n回头天地皆青玉，瞥眼山河尽紫花。\n双手扶将千劫柳，两人同御万京车。\n玄精乐奏鸾凤阵，一席陵冈袅玉跏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6508,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彤玉诗二首 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"红鹤飞鸣听玉珰，紫云深处唱金羊。\n一杯胶雨山河啸，千镜澄风宇宙香。\n宝气纷笼青凤影，天花争漾赤龙光。\n万霄团结玲珑璧，一体清宁日月长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6509,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白凌上果","author":"无名氏","text":"修佛修仙大道场，脱离地狱即天堂。\n半千年外生真圣，百万劫中诞玉皇。\n人世最怜禽兽苦，龙霄惟有鬼神忙。\n明明说与君知得，子孝臣忠觅秘方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6510,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉柬梅杜","author":"无名氏","text":"万里长桥九节虹，一团暝色转朣胧。\n原多胜友居天上，更有同人在月中。\n剪翠堂前湘竹冷，飞花殿里海棠红。\n年愁百二吾皇悯，卅载三旋并御风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6511,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"螺园诗三十首 其十七 报峨轩","author":"陶楚生","text":"桑田沧海世如流，万劫筹山此处求。\n座下金羊惊暖冱，眼前玉兔识春秋。\n瑶池殿上灵椿酒，阳子宫中碧杏瓯。\n报说人间圆日近，黄河清处是丹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6512,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"螺园诗三十首 其二十 聚香栏","author":"陶楚生","text":"十二雕栏尽白珩，卖花声里唱流莺。\n月来露溅胭脂瘦，风去云牵琥珀轻。\n瑶国龙须兰麝蔼，仙姬凤骨玉香莹。\n酣来忘却千宫锦，倒卧瑶阶碧汉横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6513,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鼠歌二首 其一","author":"无名氏","text":"天地小如喉，红轮自吞吐。\n多少世间人，都被红轮误。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6514,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鼠歌二首 其二","author":"无名氏","text":"去去去此间，不是留侬处。\n侬住三十三天天外天，玉皇为侬养男女。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6515,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹦鹉诗","author":"无名氏","text":"我本山货店中鸟，不识台司衙内尊。\n最是伤心怀旧主，难将巧语博新恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6516,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚春五首用杨孟载韵 其四","author":"谢晋","text":"心閒无梦到南柯，惟惜残春又欲过。\n一径绿阴芳树合，半帘红雨落花多。\n闲吟诗到清新句，坐看杯生潋滟波。\n自是经朝书倦读，不关中酒卧林阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6517,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过枫桥留别城西诸友","author":"谢晋","text":"烦君远饯意偏饶，念我离群乍寂寥。\n祖帐雨催诗欲就，邮亭风劲酒频浇。\n舟移射渎黄昏近，路转江村碧树遥。\n记取今宵分手处，乌啼时节过枫桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6518,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春过望亭驿喜晴追次唐李嘉祐韵","author":"谢晋","text":"远望晴烟散绿蘋，推篷起坐整乌巾。\n野花开处多临驿，水鸟飞来似送人。\n愁里听穷三日雨，客边吟别一分春。\n今朝已有寻芳客，来往东风陌上尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6519,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛社夜泊二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"沽酒新安驿，停舟洛社桥。\n家乡看渐远，愁杀是今宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6520,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛社夜泊二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"风动波摇月，窗开光映灯。\n今宵栖泊处，始觉在毗陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6521,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅泊奔牛㙋下次钱经韵","author":"谢晋","text":"收帆时候日初斜，旅泊奔牛近酒家。\n风起冻云天欲雪，溪流寒月浪生花。\n连宵诗酒叨陪席，明日图书拟共车。\n且向㙋南同一醉，任他人语夜喧哗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6522,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新丰港","author":"谢晋","text":"岁逼穷冬未肯晴，阴寒日日阻修程。\n云迷故里家何在，潮入新丰水又生。\n酒市有花梅作旆，客舟无皿瓠为觥。\n羁怀自是多伤感，愁绝非关听雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6523,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹徒湾莫泊","author":"谢晋","text":"浦溆春潮去复回，客舟风阻未能开。\n半篷残雪留寒在，几树斜阳送晚来。\n望阙心随云影度，思家愁听雁声哀。\n京师要拟明朝至，先向江神酹一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6524,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腊月二十七日次江口","author":"谢晋","text":"出浦望斜月，隔江闻棹歌。\n家从今日远，愁比昨宵多。\n野烧疑烽火，乡心逐逝波。\n一年惟两日，又向客边过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6525,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过金山寺贻钱经","author":"谢晋","text":"江心孤峙郁崔嵬，一水中分两岸开。\n风外晚钟随远棹，两边春树锁层台。\n龙惊咒钵山僧去，鸥送供厨贾客回。\n未及登临君莫恨，更期归日拟同来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6526,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜宿茅公渡盛秀才寓馆","author":"谢晋","text":"爆竹喧喧起四邻，茅公渡口岁逡巡。\n风尘路远难为客，霜鬓来朝畏见春。\n檐外雨声催腊尽，枕边乡梦到家频。\n遥怜堂上围炉处，传饮屠苏少一人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6527,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日雨中与乡友朱瑛留盛秀才馆","author":"谢晋","text":"梅柳共缤纷，京华又见春。\n还持新岁酒，相劝故乡人。\n晓雨妨来客，寥郊绝去轮。\n缘知佳节在，不敢泪沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6528,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻陆玘值雪就宿","author":"谢晋","text":"迢递似山阴，无舟亦见寻。\n呼儿寒贳酒，留我夜弹琴。\n灯晕花初结，壶残漏欲沉。\n不知门外雪，今夜几多深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6529,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨寄陆玘","author":"谢晋","text":"到京将一月，多半雨中春。\n衣润香薰彻，囊空酒贳频。\n缄书佣乞米，卧雪倦干人。\n独赖云间友，相过不厌贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6530,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日","author":"谢晋","text":"风雨荒斋睡起迟，拥衾无语独支颐。\n今朝客里逢人日，却忆故园梅发时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6531,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日旅怀二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"行囊萧索总尘埃，花柳参差是处开。\n赖有平生豪兴在，从教春色恼人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6532,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日旅怀二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"游子思亲泪未乾，春来顿觉带围宽。\n客边憔悴无人问，空把家书日日看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6533,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"依依残梦带馀醒，欹枕思量起未成。\n应是朝来春色好，街头时有卖花声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6534,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"帘幕风微篆有香，起来时候已斜阳。\n梨花云冷不成梦，蛱蝶一双飞过墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6535,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦归","author":"谢晋","text":"游子思家切，终宵只梦归。\n觉来疑乍别，续去可重依。\n童稚争牵袂，妻孥懒下机。\n他时真到日，应诉见还非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6536,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题红梅","author":"谢晋","text":"半生诗酒度年华，屡醉扬州散吏家。\n今日重来东阁里，吟成方识是梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6537,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"谢晋","text":"两树松花落径苔，一溪烟雾锁香台。\n多情最是林间客，半启荆扉待我来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6538,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题谢季文梦草池诗卷","author":"谢晋","text":"诗思兼春思，蒙茸触处新。\n轻随烟苒苒，低拂浪粼粼。\n清趣休文藻，芳情托翠蘋。\n吟来能彷佛，觉后怯逡巡。\n风静疏帘午，冰澌浅水春。\n怀贤今总切，追咏更何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6539,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄马敬","author":"谢晋","text":"生涯心事两相违，旧业荒凉恨未遗。\n秋尽始看黄叶陨，岁寒惟许赤心知。\n橘香江上思亲处，雁过灯前忆弟时。\n赖有贤郎能继述，年来能解诵君诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6540,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄钱经","author":"谢晋","text":"闻君近滞白云司，已分清贫众所知。\n病久家人情稍薄，路遥乡友问应迟。\n空江莫雨怀同棹，孤馆寒镫忆共诗。\n欲拟清溪寻旧约，未知何日到京师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6541,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄唐鸐","author":"谢晋","text":"梅花清入梦，夜半忽思君。\n千里窗前月，孤心江上云。\n诗坛谁结伴，酒社惜离群。\n何日陪吟杖，寻题竹下分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6542,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁尽日写怀","author":"谢晋","text":"去年寒尽日，正起故乡思。\n今日空齐里，翻思在客时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6543,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗寒夜","author":"谢晋","text":"江云黯黯夜寒生，风晕镫花结未成。\n枕畔泪珠檐外雨，隔窗同滴到天明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈绍先","author":"谢晋","text":"东风初解頖池冰，之子今朝远赴征。\n故里相知惟我最，少年同辈有谁能。\n梅横水驿门前月，船映江村寺里镫。\n此去不须凭问候，五云多处是金陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日归城南旧居见山茶独开感而赋之","author":"谢晋","text":"因循两月未还家，门掩苍苔一径斜。\n春意不教长寂寞，群芳开到是山茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春雨中写怀三首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"江皋日日听鸣鸠，独卧看书懒下楼。\n春草何如春梦短，人愁不似雨声愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春雨中写怀三首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"小阁焚香户半扃，乌皮矮几素罗屏。\n不因听雨尘心静，长日何缘学道经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春雨中写怀三首 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"春阴漠漠锁亭台，莺未曾啼燕未来。\n人事不知花厌雨，漫盛檐溜养瓶梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狂与答吴允中见寄","author":"谢晋","text":"昔年曾客凤皇州，终日清狂不解愁。\n醉咏新诗惊俗客，笑扶红袖上歌楼。\n一春每费千金赏，三度都来几日游。\n回首故交应感慨，相思同白少年头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈暹翁还白门兼简翁婿吴允中","author":"谢晋","text":"东风缭乱送飞花，啼鸟声中换物华。\n梦境青山犹在客，春来白下未还家。\n一帆细雨空江暝，千里平芜去路赊。\n遥想馆甥应待久，秦淮日日望归槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薛彦英竹堂诗","author":"谢晋","text":"瑛翁堂前清景胜，绿玉阴森万馀顷。\n当年结构杳难寻，于今渐得开三径。\n三径苍苔厚翠茵，半帘湘影隔红尘。\n寄言尘外来观者，须到阶前问主人。\n南阶清问疑无日，北牖萧骚风雨集。\n有时卧向石床听，薄暮不知烟雾湿。\n八窗珑葱爽气多，林声静与琴声和。\n凉生枕簟疑秋早，月到庭除觉夜过。\n春风昨夜吹新绿，粉箨飘香零簌簌。\n飞来百鸟不敢喧，畏有孤凰深处宿。\n此君高怀随处安，我欲结交同岁寒。\n何当携酒寻幽赏，日日醉我青琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城西赏梅用东坡韵","author":"谢晋","text":"昔年曾居云水村，暗香绕榻侵诗魂。\n吟边梦里长相忆，清思恍到罗浮昏。\n今年移家近西郭，亦有一树开南园。\n寒枝良僵苍藓剥，冷艳落寞春风温。\n几朝幽鸟唤人起，半窗疏影交晴暾。\n披衣起坐对觞咏，何必扣遍山家门。\n旧游已去不复醒，高歌且醉花间尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏花","author":"谢晋","text":"春意竞喧嚾，撩人半出垣。\n红轻销醉色，粉薄露啼痕。\n摇动春疑闹，开齐昼觉繁。\n深藏沽酒店，斜绕劝农村。\n依柳莺多语，偎桃坛暗翻。\n枝寒横晓月，窗白映晴暾。\n坛静飘琴荐，林幽灿药轩。\n隔帘微雨夜，香到欲消魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送春二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"一春苦被春相恼，及到春归更恼人。\n怪底今朝轻别去，空留啼鸟伴吟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送春二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"空庭草长燕交飞，独坐闲吟昼掩扉。\n风雨满城花落尽，几人閒得送春归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸳鸯","author":"谢晋","text":"鸠逐妇何苦，鸳鸯独可怜。\n池塘风雨夜，犹并一双眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题花坞醉归图二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"香熟家家酒，花明处处春。\n年来为多病，愁见醉归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题花坞醉归图二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"幽鸟唤提壶，桃花映酒炉。\n田家春社散，野老醉相扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词二章 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"芳草，芳草，二月青犹未了。\n和烟和雨路长，千里万里断肠。\n断肠断肠肠断，飞絮落花撩乱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词二章 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"清镜，清镜，蝉鬓蛾眉相映。\n朝开暮掩少尘，白发多於去春。\n去春去春春去，原上阮郎归未。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樱桃","author":"谢晋","text":"灿灿悬珠实，垂垂拂翠苔。\n莺欺人不在，含去又飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得江村送别送人起复","author":"谢晋","text":"荷叶暗汀洲，江村暮雨收。\n钟声随棹远，渔父对人愁。\n起复衣仍素，行装扇及秋。\n骊驹歌欲尽，凉月在西楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题焦道成画","author":"谢晋","text":"何处画相关，南湖销夏湾。\n波光浴几上，帆影送窗间。\n琴响来玄鹤，笼开放白鹇。\n几株霜晓叶，一带雨晴山。\n彷佛闻樵唱，依稀见牧还。\n平生赋归兴，坐对转清閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒鸦图","author":"谢晋","text":"空江阴霾断舟楫，芦苇萧萧远相接。\n洲中栖息一群鸦，宛似梢头未翻叶。\n高枝翮冻吹将落，低枝亚水惊涛恶。\n上林全树多好枝，何不飞去荣处乐。\n飞不去兮争奈何，流水孤村无网罗。\n会待柔风布晴暖，高翔远翥迎春和。\n更愿年年黍禾熟，饮啄飞鸣时往复。\n朝风莫雨亦不移，长向田家树头宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之京","author":"谢晋","text":"西风扫云天似洗，红日初升沧海底。\n吴歈楚舞满船头，相送行人渡江水。\n江水东流燕北飞，行人此别意何之。\n不辞八月云阳路，独携琴剑朝京师。\n京师自古繁华地，佳气葱葱五云际。\n长安大道接天衢，千步回廊连主第。\n银鞍绣毂拥香尘，蝉鬓蛾眉日日新。\n几处青楼相对起，一群娇鸟共争春。\n春光浩浩花如锦，莺啭雕窗妓犹寝。\n云间直卖待帆归，白下长干烧烛饮。\n忆昨少年豪兴多，北堂南陌遍经过。\n云间陆玘誇词赋，卢家莫愁新按歌。\n闻卿亦是曾游客，到处春风总行迹。\n今朝应荐上天官，无复追欢似畴昔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈大本","author":"谢晋","text":"每恨经年别，相思隔楚江。\n已看秋过半，复见燕归双。\n夜雨惊寒枕，凉蕉近客窗。\n身癯几露骨，心静不离腔。\n兴去诗难就，愁来酒可降。\n终当期后会，谈笑对寒缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"谢晋","text":"野水净无埃，秋痕欲上苔。\n自缘凉坐久，不为看山来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吴门四老图","author":"谢晋","text":"春风吹鬓雪娑娑，半度衣冠尚永和。\n人比睢阳还较少，图成商岭不争多。\n樽中有酒欢须尽，身后无传老共何。\n欲拟明朝一相访，来听林下紫芝歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]